TEXT 64 32 Left 3 ;StrongARM comparator - Figure 4 recreation
TEXT 1456 640 Left 2 ;FIRST RUN
TEXT 1456 688 Left 2 ;Run, then plot clk, vinp, outp and outn.
TEXT 1456 728 Left 2 ;CLK low: both outputs reset high.
TEXT 1456 784 Left 2 ;At 16 ns: expect outp high, outn low.
TEXT 1456 832 Left 2 ;At 26 ns: expect outp low, outn high.
TEXT 1456 912 Left 2 ;SIZING / ASSUMPTIONS
TEXT 1456 960 Left 2 ;L = 180n for all devices.
TEXT 1456 1008 Left 2 ;M1-M5, M12-M13: W=720n.
TEXT 1456 1056 Left 2 ;M6-M8, M11: W=1.13u.
TEXT 1456 1104 Left 2 ;M9-M10: W=360n.
TEXT 1456 1168 Left 2 ;M12/M13 sizing interprets table M13-M14 typo.
TEXT 1456 1216 Left 2 ;vinn=vrefn=0.8 V is a chosen input setup.
TEXT 1456 1264 Left 2 ;5 fF loads and 20 ps clock edges are chosen.
TEXT 64 1424 Left 2 ;TEACHING MODELS: arbitrary Level-1 parameters; replace for process-accurate results.
TEXT 64 1472 Left 2 !.model NDEMO NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=120u GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7\n+ LAMBDA=0.05 TOX=4n CGSO=0.2n CGDO=0.2n)\n.model PDEMO PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=45u GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7\n+ LAMBDA=0.05 TOX=4n CGSO=0.2n CGDO=0.2n)
TEXT 64 1648 Left 2 ;CLOCK / INPUT SOURCES - executable SPICE directives
TEXT 64 1696 Left 2 !VCLK clk 0 PULSE(0 1.8 2n 20p 20p 4.98n 10n)\nVINP vinp 0 PWL(0 1 20n 1 20.1n 0.6 40n 0.6 40.1n 1 60n 1 60.1n 0.6 80n 0.6)\nVINN vinn 0 0.8\nVREFP vrefp 0 0.8\nVREFN vrefn 0 0.8
TEXT 64 1920 Left 2 !.tran 0 80n 0 1p
TEXT 64 1968 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 64 2048 Left 2 !.meas tran td_high TRIG V(clk) VAL=0.9 RISE=2 TARG V(outn) VAL=0.9 FALL=2\n.meas tran td_low TRIG V(clk) VAL=0.9 RISE=3 TARG V(outp) VAL=0.9 FALL=1\n.meas tran pavg AVG (-V(vdd)*I(VDD)) FROM=10n TO=70n\n.meas tran pdp_high PARAM pavg*td_high
TEXT 64 2240 Left 2 ;View > SPICE Output Log shows delay (s), power (W), and PDP (J).
TEXT 64 2160 Left 2 !.meas tran t_reset TRIG V(clk) VAL=0.9 FALL=2 TARG V(outn) VAL=0.9 RISE=2
TEXT 64 2184 Left 2 !.meas tran t_avg_high PARAM (td_high+t_reset)/2
TEXT 64 2208 Left 2 !.meas tran pdp_avg_high PARAM pavg*t_avg_high
